<p>A calculator for working out your path to Financial Independence, designed specifically for UK and Australian residents. It accounts for the different pension access ages and tax-advantaged accounts in each country.</p>

<p><strong>Choose your situation:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>UK Only</strong> - Workplace pension, SIPP, and ISA</li>
  <li><strong>Australia Only</strong> - Superannuation and taxable savings</li>
  <li><strong>Both Countries</strong> - For those with finances split across UK and Australia, with live currency conversion</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Note:</strong> Your main residence is typically excluded from FIRE calculations. If you own your home outright, factor the lack of rent/mortgage into your retirement spending. If planning to downsize, include the expected equity release in your accessible investments.</p>

